      "parameters": {
        "content": "## UI-only setup (n8n 2.30.8)\n1. Create task-state and trace Data Tables using `docs.md` in the repository root.\n2. Select them in CAS persist (insert+update) and Orchestrator Load task.\n3. Assign Planner/Verifier credentials.\n4. Bind CAS persist, Excel adapter/agent, SCHEDULE Retrieval/Builder, MAS Trace Writer, and **Error — MAS Case Handler**.\n5. Load expert keyword instructions/schema JSON into `schedule_mvp`.\n6. Test start → HITL → delegation → validation → verification → inline .INC.\n\nSCHEDULE input and result remain bounded text inside n8n. Multi-file: drag-and-drop several `.inc/.data/.grdecl` into `schedule_files` (optional `schedule_root`); materializer builds `root_path` + `include_files` for Builder. No ZIP, no host filesystem scan.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 5
      },
